Package: linux-broadcast
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Ayush <arzvaak@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, pipewire-bin
Homepage: https://arzvaak.github.io/linux-broadcast/
Description: NVIDIA AFX voice processing for PipeWire
 Linux Broadcast creates a processed virtual microphone with Noise Removal,
 BNR 2.0, Room Echo Removal, Noise and Room Echo, and Studio Voice on
 compatible NVIDIA RTX GPUs. The NVIDIA model and runtime payload is included.
